{"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI12ViewModifierP"],"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudstoolbartop"]}],"metadata":{"platforms":[{"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false},{"name":"iPadOS","introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false},{"name":"Mac Catalyst","introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false},{"name":"visionOS","introducedAt":"1.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false}],"externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents14OUDSToolBarTopV","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSToolBarTop"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSToolBarTop"}],"title":"OUDSToolBarTop","symbolKind":"struct","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"roleHeading":"Structure"},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSToolBarTop"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Warning"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": If an item is placed in principal position, the subtitle is never displayed (whatever "},{"code":"hasLargeTitle","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is), because"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI’s "},{"code":".principal","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" placement only replaces the inline compact bar title, not "},{"code":".navigationSubtitle()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (iOS 26+), which would"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"otherwise keep rendering next to the item with no visible title next to it. The title itself is displayed only if "},{"code":"hasLargeTitle","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is "},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (in that case it appears below the bar, in large title mode, not inside it)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Appearances","text":"Appearances","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"With Liquid Glass \/ iOS 26+ the OS will change the rendering of the toolbar items depending to the context:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The OS can group the items of same types in one group with kind of rectangle (e.g. views with menus)"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"But for buttons items they will remain isolated"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The placement of the title can be leading or centered depending to the length of the text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The text can be truncated if there is not enough remaining space"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The OS can apply another style for the back button"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Without Liquid Glass \/ iOS 18 and lower, the OS won’t change that much the style of the toolbar items, Items won’t be visually grouped."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The appearance of navigation bar elements is changed by the "},{"code":"oudsNavigationBarAppearance","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"View","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" helper, which must be applied to the root view of the "},{"code":"NavigationStack","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Technical-constraints","text":"Technical constraints","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To ensure the back button and text use the correct color on iOS 18 and earlier, apply the following accent color in your main view:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["    struct AppMainView: View {","        var body: some View {","            ContentView()","                .accentColor(theme.colors.contentDefault)","        }","    }"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Platform-considerations","text":"Platform considerations","type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The component is available on iOS, iPadOS, and visionOS"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The component is not available for watchOS, tvOS and macOS"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Badges-uses","text":"Badges uses","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For iOS 26 with Liquid Glass, the system badge is used because the OUDS badge component does not provide a suitable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rendering with the glassified effect applied on the top toolbar."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For iOS until 18 and without Liquid Glass  OUDS badge component is always used."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Code-sample","text":"Code sample","type":"heading"},{"code":["    ContentView()","        .toolBarTop(\"Title\",","            leadingItems: {","                OUDSToolBarItem(navigation: .back())","            },","            principalItem: OUDSToolBarItem(icon: Image(decorative: \"search\"), accessibilityLabel: \"Search\") { \/* Action to process *\/ },","            trailingItems: {","                OUDSToolBarItem(label: \"Label\") { \/* Action to process *\/ }","                OUDSToolBarItem(icon: Image(decorative: \"some_image\"), accessibilityLabel: \"Label\") { \/* Action to process *\/ }","            }","        )"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"code":"View","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" helper can also be used to apply a SwiftUI toolbar configuration."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["    toolBarTop(_:hasLargeTitle:subtitle:leadingItems:principalItem:trailingItems:)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Design-documentation","text":"Design documentation","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-ios-tool-bar-top"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Themes-rendering","text":"Themes rendering","type":"heading"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Liquid-Glass","text":"Liquid Glass","type":"heading"},{"level":4,"anchor":"Orange","text":"Orange","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_toolBarTop_LiquidGlass_Orange_light"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"image","identifier":"component_toolBarTop_LiquidGlass_Orange_dark"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":4,"anchor":"Orange-Compact","text":"Orange Compact","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_toolBarTop_LiquidGlass_OrangeCompact_light"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"image","identifier":"component_toolBarTop_LiquidGlass_OrangeCompact_dark"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":4,"anchor":"Sosh","text":"Sosh","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_toolBarTop_LiquidGlass_Sosh_light"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"image","identifier":"component_toolBarTop_LiquidGlass_Sosh_dark"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":4,"anchor":"Wireframe","text":"Wireframe","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"comp